    "title": "Selectmen voluntarily recognize EMS, fire union - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Susan Gonsalves ,\n16 hours ago\nSPENCER – Selectmen on October 26 gave union recognition to firefighters and EMS employees. Two weeks ago, firefighters Brandon Muller and International Association of Fire Fighters district field chief Rob Green asked the town to voluntarily recognize the bargaining units. Personnel expressed an interest in joining the Professional Fire Fighters of Massachusetts as well as the IAFF.\nRead full article",
